          "description": "The romance of southern France is undeniable, best enjoyed from your base at Hôtel UP Ultimate Provence, a boutique spa-cation hidden among the vineyards in sun-kissed Var. The hotel is located on a 113-acre wine estate: while you're here, enjoy a tasting or two in the tasting room or learn from master sommeliers at the ultra-modern winery. Good food and wine go hand in hand, and at UP Restaurant, indulge in the chef's innovative creations crafted from seasonal and locally sourced ingredients.",
